(-8 size, +16 deflection, +49 natural), touch 18, flat-footed 67; Base Atk +50; Grp +88; Atk +65 melee (4d8+22/19-20, bite); Full Atk +65 melee (4d8+22/19-20, bite) and +65 melee (4d6+11, 2 claws) and +64 melee (2d8+11, 2 wings) and +65 melee (4d6+33, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of force 35d12, DC 50), crush 4d8+33 (DC 50), frightful presence (DC 51), tail sweep 2d8+33 (DC 50); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., blur, damage reduction 20/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, resilient sphere, spell resistance 42, spells (caster level 21st), wall of force; AL N; SV Fort +42, Ref +27, Will +43; Str 55, Dex 10, Con 41, Int 42, Wis 43, Cha 42\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +25, Bluff +25, Concentration +68, Craft (alchemy) +25, Diplomacy +69, Disable Device +25, Escape Artist +53, Gather Information +25, Heal +25, Hide -7, Intimidate +69, Jump +31, Knowledge (all) +69, Listen +71, Move Silently +9, Open Lock +9, Search +69, Sense Motive +69, Spellcraft +25, Spot +71, Survival +25, Tumble +9, Use Magic Device +69; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Critical (bite), Improved Initiative, Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Force Dragon\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Force Dragon</h3></p><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Force Dragon, Mature adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal Dragon (Force)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>50d12+750 (1,075 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., fly 300 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>67 (-8 size, +16 deflection, +49 natural), touch 18, flat-footed 67<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+50/+88<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +65 (4d8+22/19-20) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +65 (4d8+22/19-20) melee, 2 Claws +65 (4d6+11) melee, 2 Wings +64 (2d8+11) melee, Tail Slap +65 (4d6+33) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of force 35d12, DC 50), crush 4d8+33 (DC 50), frightful presence (DC 51), tail sweep 2d8+33 (DC 50)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Blindsense 60 ft., blur, damage reduction 20/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, <i>resilient sphere</i>, spell resistance 42, spells (caster level 21st), <i>wall of force</i><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +42, Ref +27, Will +43<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 55, Dex 10, Con 41, Int 42, Wis 43, Cha 42<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Appraise +25, Bluff +25, Concentration +68, Craft (alchemy) +25, Diplomacy +69, Disable Device +25, Escape Artist +53, Gather Information +25, Heal +25, Hide -7, Intimidate +69, Jump +31, Knowledge (all) +69, Listen +71, Move Silently +9, Open Lock +9, Search +69, Sense Motive +69, Spellcraft +25, Spot +71, Survival +25, Tumble +9, Use Magic Device +69<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Critical (bite), Improved Initiative, Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Any land and underground<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>35<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Double standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Usually neutral<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>51-54 HD (Colossal)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Force)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Any land and underground</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Rating\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Rating:</b> Wyrmling 13; very young 19; young 21; juvenile 25; young adult 28; adult 31; mature adult 35; old 37; very old 39; ancient 43; wyrm 50; great wyrm 59</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Double standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Usually neutral</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 21-24 HD (Huge); very young 26-29 HD (Huge); young 31-34 HD (Gargantuan); juvenile 36-39 HD (Gargantuan); young adult 41-44 HD (Gargantuan); adult 46-49 HD (Gargantuan); mature adult 51-54 HD (Colossal); old 56-59 HD (Colossal); very old 61-64 HD (Colossal); ancient 66-69 HD (Colossal); wyrm 71-74 HD (Colossal+); great wyrm 76+ HD (Colossal+)</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Force Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5><b>Force Dragons by Age</b> </h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td><b>Age</b> <br/></td>\n<td><b>Size</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Hit Dice (hp)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Str</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Dex</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Con</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Int</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Wis</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Cha</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Base Attack/</b><br/>\n<b>Grapple</b><br/></td> <td><b>Attack</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Fort Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Ref Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Will Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Breath Weapon (DC)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Frightful Presence DC</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Wyrmling<br/></td>\n<td>H<br/></td>\n<td>20d12+100 (230)<br/></td>\n<td>31<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n<td>18<br/></td>\n<td>19<br/></td>\n<td>18<br/></td>\n<td>+20/+38<br/></td>\n<td>+28<br/></td>\n<td>+17<br/></td>\n<td>+12<br/></td>\n<td>+16<br/></td>\n<td>5d12 (25)<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Very young<br/></td>\n<td>H<br/></td>\n<td>25d12+150 (312)<br/></td>\n<td>35<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n<td>+25/+45<br/></td>\n<td>+35<br/></td>\n<td>+20<br/></td>\n<td>+14<br/></td>\n<td>+20<br/></td>\n<td>10d12 (28)<br/></td>\n<td>28<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Young<br/></td>\n<td>G<br/></td>\n<td>30d12+210 (405)<br/></td>\n<td>39<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>25<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n<td>+30/+56<br/></td>\n<td>+40<br/></td>\n<td>+24<br/></td>\n<td>+17<br/></td>\n<td>