opic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 21-24 HD (Huge); very young 26-29 HD (Huge); young 31-34 HD (Gargantuan); juvenile 36-39 HD (Gargantuan); young adult 41-44 HD (Gargantuan); adult 46-49 HD (Gargantuan); mature adult 51-54 HD (Colossal); old 56-59 HD (Colossal); very old 61-64 HD (Colossal); ancient 66-69 HD (Colossal); wyrm 71-74 HD (Colossal+); great wyrm 76+ HD (Colossal+)</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Force Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5><b>Force Dragons by Age</b> </h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td><b>Age</b> <br/></td>\n<td><b>Size</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Hit Dice (hp)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Str</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Dex</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Con</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Int</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Wis</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Cha</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Base Attack/</b><br/>\n<b>Grapple</b><br/></td> <td><b>Attack</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Fort Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Ref Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Will Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Breath Weapon (DC)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Frightful Presence DC</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Wyrmling<br/></td>\n<td>H<br/></td>\n<td>20d12+100 (230)<br/></td>\n<td>31<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n<td>18<br/></td>\n<td>19<br/></td>\n<td>18<br/></td>\n<td>+20/+38<br/></td>\n<td>+28<br/></td>\n<td>+17<br/></td>\n<td>+12<br/></td>\n<td>+16<br/></td>\n<td>5d12 (25)<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Very young<br/></td>\n<td>H<br/></td>\n<td>25d12+150 (312)<br/></td>\n<td>35<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n<td>+25/+45<br/></td>\n<td>+35<br/></td>\n<td>+20<br/></td>\n<td>+14<br/></td>\n<td>+20<br/></td>\n<td>10d12 (28)<br/></td>\n<td>28<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Young<br/></td>\n<td>G<br/></td>\n<td>30d12+210 (405